; Expect: CloseMovie: the movie is 0
; A debug build (-d) stops CloseMovie on the 0 of a movie that failed to open. Other builds ignore it.
If GetEnv$("BLITZLLVM_TEST_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("CloseMovie: the movie is 0 (release build, not checked).")
CloseMovie OpenMovie("does_not_exist.mpg")
Print "CloseMovie did not stop the program."
